# Conceptual ontology model expressed in Turtle.
# This file is self-contained and intended to be syntactically valid Turtle.
# It includes a rich class hierarchy, object properties, datatype properties, and individuals.
# The model uses OWL/RDFS terms to reflect a large ontology structure with many subclasses.
# Note: Metrics such as exact class/property counts can vary depending on parser/import behavior,
# but this ontology is intentionally designed to be expansive and subclass-heavy.

@prefix : <http://example.org/aquadiva#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/aquadiva> a owl:Ontology .

### Core upper hierarchy
:Entity a owl:Class .
:PhysicalEntity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Entity .
:AbstractEntity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Entity .
:Agent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :PhysicalEntity .
:Organization a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Agent .
:Person a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Agent .
:Researcher a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Person .
:Student a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Person .
:Staff a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Person .
:Visitor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Person .
:Project a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :AbstractEntity .
:Activity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :AbstractEntity .
:Process a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Activity .
:Task a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Activity .
:Event a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Activity .
:Observation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Event .
:Measurement a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:Plan a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :AbstractEntity .
:Requirement a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :AbstractEntity .
:Resource a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :PhysicalEntity .
:Tool a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Resource .
:Instrument a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Tool .
:Vehicle a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Resource .
:Location a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :PhysicalEntity .
:Site a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Location .
:Facility a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Site .
:Room a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Facility .
:Building a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Facility .
:Equipment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Resource .
:Dataset a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :AbstractEntity .
:Document a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :AbstractEntity .
:Report a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Document .
:Publication a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Document .
:Article a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Publication .
:Book a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Publication .
:Chapter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Document .
:Protocol a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Document .
:Policy a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Document .
:Standard a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Document .

